PURPOSE: Define naming conventions and standards for OnAir project

CONVENTIONS:

1. BACK NAVIGATION:
   - UiEvents: onBackPressed
   - Events: goBack
   - Binding: events.goBack = navigator::goBack

2. NAVIGATION NAMING:
   - Route: {N}Route (e.g., SplashRoute)
   - Navigate function: navigateTo{N}() (e.g., navigateToSplash())
   - Module NavKey: {Module}NavKey (e.g., OnboardingNavKey)
   - Navigator extension: {module}Navigator (e.g., onboardingNavigator)

3. SCREEN COMPONENTS:
   - Screen: {N}Screen
   - View: {N}View
   - Events: {N}Events
   - UiEvents: {N}UiEvents
   - State: {N}State
   - Intent: {N}Intent
   - Effect: {N}Effect
   - ViewModel: {N}ViewModel

4. EVENT NAMING BY TYPE:
   - Back navigation: onBackPressed (UiEvents), goBack (Events)
   - Navigate to X: navigateTo{X} (Events callback)
   - Button click: on{Action}Click (e.g., onSubmitClick)
   - Text change: on{Field}Change (e.g., onEmailChange)
   - Toggle: on{Item}Toggle (e.g., onNotificationToggle)
   - Submit: on{Action} (e.g., onSubmit)

5. VISIBILITY:
   - All screen-level: internal

6. UIEVENTS BINDING RULE:
   - If needs ViewModel (data ops): vm.handleIntent()
   - If pure navigation: direct events.XXX access

7. PACKAGE:
   - pkg: kr.sdbk.{feature}.impl.{screen}

8. MODULE NAVIGATION (if {parent}/api exists):
   - api/{Module}NavKey.kt: interface, navigateTo{N}(), {N}Route
   - impl/{Module}Navigator.kt: OnAirEntryProviderScope ext, entry<{N}Route>
